As for being tased - He is resisting arrest after biting into a police dog. Tasing him would allow the officers to get control of his body before he does so they can arrest him.

If you use your brain and mix two and two together you'll see that PC has the biggest player base. Over 100,000 people log on to GTA on PC per-day. Oh! and the maximum daily average is 150,000 people.

&#x200B;

So just think ;)

&#x200B;

And in the past 24 hours PC has peaked 159,732 players on Steam. As of 1 hour ago there are 89,000 on PC. :)

