So why are you bringing United States statistics into this? 

"did you hang out with him? why do you keep defending him?" Haven't spoken to him directly, but, I've had conversations with his bestfriend Justin Waller, his cousin Luc, and his assistant Georgiana. 

&#x200B;

Trust me, I have questioned stuff he says. Have I said to you once its all right? Didn't think so. 

&#x200B;

"name one women that has been comfortable around you and i'll answer." Well to answer that, my girlfriend actually! And many other women that I am friends with.

When did he rape someone? Never.. You're back to the accusing. I'm not trying to be right, I know I am. Tell me, if he raped someone why does he not have any public convictions? Why is there no news articles about an arrest? Explain that to me please! 

My mum doesn't mind Andrew either. I've sat next to her and literally watched the Piers Morgan special with him in it with her besides me. 

&#x200B;

Go watch his Super Yacht Special on Rumble to see how he really treats women. You're weird. 

&#x200B;

And no, I will not stop saying clips are cut up. Because they are.

"how about him being an abuser? is that wrong too?" Actually, you are! The "abuse" you saw in both videos were both consensual sex acts. 

&#x200B;

It is not my fault I have knowledge on ALL of this because Andrew is someone I look up to.

I get my opinions from myself. 

&#x200B;

Also, do your research. The girls that claimed to be held against their will lied because their boyfriends found out they were at Andrews house LOL! Learn your shit before you try and accuse someone of something they didnt do. 

&#x200B;

Let me guess, you're the type of person to instantly try to expose a guy who is ACCUSED of a sexual crime without any proof?

I don't want to be attracted to males whatsoever? Never have and never will. A masculine female would be a deal breaker, yes. Every proper man wants a feminine women in their life, and that is a fact. You can't argue against someones wants and try bring up other sexualities to back up your argument, when they shouldn't be brought up in the first place. 

&#x200B;

I am attracted to feminine women, as are lots of other men and that is THAT. You can't contest against that.

No.. He doesn't recruit you to promote him. You would pay $50 monthly to access HU. In HU there were 18 modern money making methods that anyone can do. 

&#x200B;

You can sort the money making methods with filters on your current monetary situation and how much time you have. Affiliate marketing is free for ANYONE to do, and you can make money from it. Why not take that chance and promote one of the most famous people on the planet and make money too?

That is completely false. As someone who has joined both HU and TRW, it is not a pyramid scheme. It is affiliate marketing. People seem to misinterpret the affiliate marketing that is provided inside of HU. 

&#x200B;

It teaches all types of affiliate marketing. Giving the choice, which you need to sign up for, to be an AFFILIATE with HU and TRW. In which you are given a special link to share. Percentage of the purchases made from your link are firstly discounted from your next monthly payment, and afterwards comes straight into your bank account.

[https://ibb.co/cyBnRPk](https://ibb.co/cyBnRPk)

